* New huge track YOKOHAMA DOCS - freestyle drift and some gimkhana
* New track ST.PETERBURG IGO - the most anticipated track of the RDS GP 2020 season
* Stage 3 of RDS CS 2020 will take place on July 31 - August 1 at N.NOVGOROD track
* Radical improvements to the PHYSICS of the car (the most significant since the release of the game):
+ increased torsional rigidity of the body - shifting became faster;
+ increased the maximum steering angle + 9°, total 68°;
+ improved tire simulation model;
+ the inertia of the engine and gearbox is increased, the revolutions drop less when clutching;
+ improved steering - even sharper and more precise control of the car in drift;
+ the accuracy of the physics calculation is increased;
* Many bugs fixed, optimization made
* Improved client stability and security

