* Huge improvements in PHYSICS:
   + Engine redesigned, the torque is more dependent on the rpm and boost pressure;
   + A new model of tire simulation - adhesion with low slippage is more important;
   + Suspension improved: springs are softer with stiffer shock absorbers for maximum grip;
   + Improved accel control and traction - acceleration in low gears is more efficient and pleasant, soft traction control system;
   + Improved steering - even more precise control of the car in the drift;
   + Physics miscalculation accuracy increased 2 times;
* New MOSCOW RING track (RDS CS 2020 Round 1 - April 3-4 on RDS GP 2019 config)
* New WINTER F MINAMI track
* New CONFIGS FOR TANDEM DRIFT on almost all tracks from Garick
* Reduced engine and tire wear - less frequent repairs
* Many bugs fixed, optimization made
* Improved stability and security of game client

